        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview",
        "verifiedAt": "2026-09-10",
        "note": "A gap rather than a new model: anthropic-claude-3-and-4 covers sonnet-4 and haiku-4 but not opus-4, and the 4.6/4.7/4.8 rules start above it. Limits and flags confirmed against the Models API, which advertises manual extended thinking (types.enabled) and not adaptive. Opus 4.5 predates the removal of non-default sampling, as anthropic-opus-4-6 records for its own generation."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anthropic-claude-5",
      "provider": "anthropic",
      "modelPattern": "^claude-(?:opus|sonnet|fable)-5(?:[-.]|$)",
      "capabilities": {
        "contextWindow": 1000000,
        "maxOutputTokens": 128000,
        "inputs": {
          "text": "supported",
          "image": "supported",
          "pdf": "supported"
        },
        "parameters": {
          "maxOutputTokens": {
            "support": "supported",
            "min": 1,
            "max": 128000
          },
          "temperature": {
            "support": "unsupported"
          },
          "reasoning": {
            "support": "supported",
            "modes": ["off", "adaptive"],
            "default": "adaptive"
          }
        }
      },
      "evidence": {
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview",
        "verifiedAt": "2026-09-10",
        "note": "One rule for the generation rather than an exact ID each: the previous ^claude-sonnet-5$ and ^claude-fable-5$ could not match a point release, so claude-fable-5-1 and claude-opus-5 resolved to unknown and the editor refused image, PDF and max-output requests against them. Limits and modality flags confirmed against the Models API for claude-opus-5, claude-sonnet-5, claude-fable-5 and claude-fable-5-1, which advertise an identical capability shape. Max output is the synchronous Messages API limit; the 300k batch beta is out of scope. Extended thinking (thinking.type enabled) is not accepted on this generation. OTS omits temperature because non-default sampling values return 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anthropic-fable-5-always-on-thinking",
      "provider": "anthropic",
      "modelPattern": "^claude-fable-5(?:-\\d+)?$",
      "capabilities": {
        "parameters": {
          "reasoning": {
            "support": "supported",
            "modes": ["adaptive"],
            "default": "adaptive"
          }
        }
      },
      "evidence": {
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview",
        "verifiedAt": "2026-09-10",
        "note": "Fable's thinking is adaptive and always on, so it cannot be turned off. Declares only the reasoning modes, overriding the family rule above and inheriting everything else from it."
      }
    },
